    "body": "When using the asdf-vm, the `elixir` script looks like this:\r\n```fish\r\n❯ which elixir\r\n/Users/philipgiuliani/.asdf/shims/elixir\r\n\r\n❯ cat /Users/philipgiuliani/.asdf/shims/elixir\r\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\r\n# asdf-plugin: elixir 1.13.3\r\n# asdf-plugin: elixir 1.13.4\r\n# asdf-plugin: elixir 1.14.1\r\nexec /Users/philipgiuliani/.asdf/bin/asdf exec \"elixir\" \"$@\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut `elixir --short-version` is already much faster than `elixir --version` (4x on my pc).",
