    "body": "I'd definitely vote for moving to `--short-version`:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ time elixir --short-version\r\n1.14.2\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________\r\nExecuted in  110.28 millis    fish           external\r\n   usr time    5.34 millis    0.04 millis    5.30 millis\r\n   sys time   11.69 millis    1.09 millis   10.60 millis\r\n\r\n\r\nvulcan on  main [⇣] via 💧 v1.14.2 (OTP 25)\r\n❯ time elixir --version\r\nErlang/OTP 25 [erts-13.1.3] [source] [64-bit] [smp:10:10] [ds:10:10:10] [async-threads:1] [jit]\r\n\r\nElixir 1.14.2 (compiled with Erlang/OTP 25)\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________\r\nExecuted in  538.10 millis    fish           external\r\n   usr time  134.87 millis    0.06 millis  134.82 millis\r\n   sys time   95.79 millis    1.10 millis   94.69 millis\r\n```",
